---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---

<Site title="Privacy Policy" description="How Purple Directive handles information when you visit purpledirective.com, buy from us or get in touch.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
    <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Version 2.0.0 · Effective September 26, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Purple Directive ("we", "us") runs purpledirective.com, where we sell clinical research
      SOPs and consulting and publish articles and tools. This policy explains what information
      we collect through the site, how we use it and the choices you have. Quell, our browser
      extension, has its own <a href="/quell/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you buy something, fill in one of our
      forms (feedback, reviews, customization requests or consulting intake), sign up for our
      newsletter, use the chat assistant or email us, we receive what you provide. That is
      usually your name, email address, organization and message.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Purchases.</strong> Checkout is handled by Stripe, which collects your payment
      details. We do not receive or store your card number. We receive your name, email
      address and what you bought so we can deliver it, along with how you found us, such as
      the link or campaign you came from.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Information collected automatically.</strong> When you visit, we collect
      information about your device and how you use the site, such as the pages you view, the
      links you click, the site that sent you, your general location, your browser and device
      type, and errors the page runs into. The chat assistant also keeps basic technical
      details, such as your IP address, with each conversation.
    </p>
    <p>
      Please do not share health information about yourself or anyone else through the site's
      forms or chat.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use It</h2>
    <p>
      We use this information to deliver your purchases, answer your questions, run the chat
      assistant, and send our newsletter if you asked for it. We also use it to understand how
      people find and use the site, including which pages, posts and links lead to purchases,
      to fix pages that break or confuse people, to keep the site secure, and to keep the
      business records we are required to keep.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you submit a review and give us permission to publish it, we may show it on the site
      with the name and role you entered. Feedback and other form messages are never published.
    </p>

    <h2>Who We Share It With</h2>
    <p>
      We share information with service providers that help us run the site and the business:
      our payment processor (Stripe), our hosting and security providers, our email delivery
      and newsletter services, and the AI service that powers the chat assistant. We may also
      disclose information when the law requires it.
    </p>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not share it for advertising.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and Similar Tools</h2>
    <p>
      Our site does not set its own cookies. We use analytics tools, including tools that
      record how visitors use the site, with page text and anything typed hidden. These tools
      use your browser's temporary session storage, which clears when you close the tab.
      Links we share in posts and emails may go through short links that note the click, so
      we can see which posts bring visitors. Stripe and our hosting provider may set cookies
      needed for checkout and security.
    </p>

    <h2>How Long We Keep It</h2>
    <p>
      We keep purchase records as long as we need them for accounting and tax. Session
      recordings are deleted within 30 days. We keep other information only as long as it is
      useful for the purposes above, or until you ask us to delete it.
    </p>

    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>
      Connections to the site are encrypted, card payments are handled by Stripe, and access
      to our records is limited. No method of sending or storing information is completely
      secure, but we work to protect what we hold.
    </p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>
      The site is meant for professionals and is not directed to children under 13. We do not
      knowingly collect information from children.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Choices</h2>
    <p>
      You can ask to see, correct or delete the information we hold about you by emailing
      <a href="mailto:info@purpledirective.com">info@purpledirective.com</a>. You can
      unsubscribe from our newsletter at any time using the link in any issue. If your browser
      sends a Global Privacy Control or Do Not Track signal, we do not make a session recording
      of your visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we will post the new version
      here with a new version number and effective date.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy? Email us at
      <a href="mailto:info@purpledirective.com">info@purpledirective.com</a>.
    </p>
    </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 680px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) 0;
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .legal-updated {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .legal-page h2:first-of-type {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-page h3 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }

  .legal-page p,
  .legal-page li {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .legal-page ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin: var(--spacing-sm) 0;
  }

  .legal-page li {
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .legal-page a {
    color: var(--purple-primary);
  }

  .legal-page code {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    padding: 0.1rem 0.4rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
</style>
